#: ../../source/index.rst:5 f1fc879b2bdd4ca790c850a04f22407d
msgid "ArduPilot Plane"
msgstr "ArduPilot Plane"

#: ../../source/index.rst:18 da7a2e7b088248938920d6b0c10c008a
msgid ""
"The open source Plane firmware running on a compatible controller board "
"gives any fixed-wing aircraft full autonomous capability. VTOL fixed-wing "
"aircraft that hover and cruise in different configurations are also included"
" under the Plane firmware."
msgstr ""
"运行在兼容控制器板上的开源Plane固件赋予任何固定翼飞机完整的自主飞行能力。以不同配置悬停和巡航的VTOL固定翼飞机也包含在Plane固件下。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:23 9e593c300f37460baa6ae6db531ddbab
msgid ""
"Plane provides advanced functions such as support for hundreds of three-"
"dimensional waypoints, automatic take-off and landing as well as "
"sophisticated mission planning and camera controls. It works with a variety "
"of :ref:`Ground Control Station <common-choosing-a-ground-station>` (GCS) "
"software for programming and mission operations and offers a complete UAV "
"solution."
msgstr ""
"Plane 提供高级功能，例如支持数百个三维航点、自动起飞和降落以及复杂的任务规划和摄像头控制。它与各种 :ref:`地面控制站 <common-"
"choosing-a-ground-station>`（GCS）软件兼容，用于编程和任务操作，提供完整的无人机解决方案。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:29 cc4d13ab05c54a8da913403aee7cee80
msgid ""
"The entire package is designed to be easily approachable for the novice, "
"while remaining open-ended for custom applications, education, and research "
"use."
msgstr "整个平台的设计易于新手上手，同时对自定义应用、教育和研究用途保持开放性。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:35 e8e573b6a16649318abf1b92fbd6af21
msgid ""
"This is the platform that won the prestigious `Outback Challenge UAV "
"competition <http://uavchallenge.org>`__ in `2012 "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/canberrauav-outback-"
"challenge-2012-debrief>`__, `2014 "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/canberrauav-outback-"
"challenge-2014-debrief>`__ and `2016 "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/canberrauav-outback-"
"challenge-2016-debrief/12162>`__ as well as the \\ `2014 Sparkfun Autonomous"
" Vehicle Competition <https://avc.sparkfun.com/2014/scores#Aerial:Fixed>`__."
msgstr ""
"这是在 `2012 <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/canberrauav-outback-"
"challenge-2012-debrief>`__、`2014 "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/canberrauav-outback-"
"challenge-2014-debrief>`__ 和 `2016 "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/canberrauav-outback-"
"challenge-2016-debrief/12162>`__ 年赢得享有盛誉的 `Outback Challenge UAV competition"
" <http://uavchallenge.org>`__ 以及 `2014 Sparkfun Autonomous Vehicle "
"Competition <https://avc.sparkfun.com/2014/scores#Aerial:Fixed>`__ 的平台。"

